One final audit caught an important serialization detail before handoff: restored GC must hold the manager-home lock, otherwise its consumer read/replace could race the transaction ledger. I’ve added that lock and a witness assertion in the regression test; I’m re-running the affected gates and will repeat the full suite because this changed runtime behavior after the prior green run.
